  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"seven halves x plus 6 y equals 25\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>25</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"five halves x plus 6 y equals 23\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>23</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>17</mn>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>18</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
