  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Multiplying the second equation in the given system by <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 10 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 12 y equals 46\"><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>46</mn></math>. Adding this equation to the first equation in the system yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis seven halves x plus 6 y right parenthesis plus left parenthesis StartFraction 10 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 12 y right parenthesis equals 25 plus 46\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"left parenthesis seven halves x plus StartFraction 10 Over 2 EndFraction x right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 6 y plus 12 y right parenthesis equals 25 plus 46\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y equals 71\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>71</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"71\"><mn>71</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, not the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>, not the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This the value of <math alttext=\"left parenthesis seven halves x plus 6 y right parenthesis plus left parenthesis five halves x plus 6 y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"6 x plus 12 y\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>6</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>12</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 17 Over 2 EndFraction x plus 18 y\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>",
